OL,3,GNEWSAGym needs replacement for
OL,4,A'diabolical' boxing ring
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Diabolical" damage caused by flooding
OL,7,Fand general wear and tear means a gym's
OL,8,Fboxing ring is unsafe for use, its head
OL,9,Fcoach says.
OL,11,FMichelle Gardiner of Forest Fighting
OL,12,FFit in Parkend, Gloucestershire, said
OL,13,Fthe ring is at the end of its life
OL,14,Fafter "more than a decade of repairs,
OL,15,Fpatches, and heavy community use".
OL,17,FA new ring, which the gyms said would
OL,18,Fallow it to expand its programmes for
OL,19,Fdifferent ages and abilities, and
OL,20,Fimprove accessibility and safety for
OL,21,Fdisabled participants, will cost
OL,22,F#3,500.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
