OL,3,GNEWSAGym needs replacement for
OL,4,A'diabolical' boxing ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Morgan, whose daughter, Lily, 10,
OL,7,Fhas taken part in national and
OL,8,Finternational competitions since
OL,9,Fstarting at Forest Fighting Fit, said
OL,10,Fthe lack of ring is preventing children
OL,11,Ffrom progressing.
